iver","kingisepp"],"bestLight":"sunset","summary":"The existing bridge is modern and uninteresting, but next to it, the pillars of the old bridge made of granite blocks, built in 1866 and blown up in 1944, have been preserved. With great care, you can find the remains of pillboxes near the bridge, and climbing up the old embankment, you can enjoy a wonderful view of the river, which in this place is very shallow and replete with rifts. Also not fa","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Kingisepp","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/77/%D0%9C%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82_%D1%87%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B7_%D0%9B%D1%83%D0%B3%D1%83_1920.jpg","thumb":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/77/%D0%9C%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82_%D1%87%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B7_%D0%9B%D1%83%D0%B3%D1%83_1920.jpg","w":1200,"h":796,"author":"Unknown authorUnknown author","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%D0%9C%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82_%D1%87%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B7_%D0%9B%D1%83%D0%B3%D1%83_1920.jpg"}},{"id":"kingisepp_wv_barracks_of_the_146th_tsaritsyno_infantry_regime","areaId":"kingisepp","name":"Barracks of the 146th Tsaritsyno Infantry Regiment","category":"landmark","tags":["photo"],"location":{"lat":59.37503,"lng":28.59912},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"kingisepp_wv_barracks_of_the_146th_tsaritsyno_infantry_regime","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsNearby":1,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-23"},"hashtags":["barracksofthe146thtsaritsynoinfantryregiment","kingisepp"],"summary":"At the end of the 18th century, a cotton manufactory was opened in Yamburg, and with it, two buildings of the Gostiny Dvor, where it was supposed to trade the products of this manufactory. But it soon became clear that this was too large-scale an undertaking for a small town, and Gostiny Dvor was simply not needed. In the 1830s, it was redesigned to accommodate the officers of the regiment quarter","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Kingisepp","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fc/Saint_Catherine%27s_Church_Kingisepp_7238.jpg/1280px-Saint_Catherine%27s_Church_Kingisepp_7238.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fc/Saint_Catherine%27s_Church_Kingisepp_7238.jpg/500px-Saint_Catherine%27s_Church_Kingisepp_7238.jpg","w":1200,"h":1806,"author":"Дмитрий Кудряшов","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Saint_Catherine%27s_Church_Kingisepp_7238.jpg"}},{"id":"kingisepp_wv_city_beach","areaId":"kingisepp","name":"City beach","category":"beach","tags":["beach","sea","nature","sunset"],"location":{"lat":59.37773,"lng":28.59046},"visitMinutes":120,"priceLevel":0,"photoSeed":"kingisepp_wv_city_beach","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsNearby":1,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-23"},"hashtags":["citybeach","kingisepp"],"bestLight":"sunset","summary":"An unequipped semi-wild beach, the main advantage of which is its location within the city. Many locals neglect this beach, preferring to go swimming in the lakes around the city. There is another small beach on the \"urban\" shore of the Luga, not far from the Catherine's Cathedral.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Kingisepp","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/%D0%9E%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%BA%D0%B8_%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BD%D1%8B%D1%85_%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BD.jpg/1280px-%D0%9E%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%BA%D0%B8_%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BD%D1%8B%D1%85_%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BD.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/%D0%9E%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%BA%D0%B8_%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BD%D1%8B%D1%85_%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BD.jpg/500px-%D0%9E%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%BA%D0%B8_%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%81%